      "body": "Hello Bogdan.\n\n1. Standard activation of the module. (admin right, extension\nactivation and settings)\n2. Install 2-3 languages\n3. Edit the language files in the installed languages\n\nTest the standard: English\nTest other languages: Change the default front-end langaues\n\n(Don't forget to keep the behavior of the browser cache in mind.)\n\n\n-- \nWith best regards / Mit freundlichen Grüßen / С уважением\n\nPeter Maier\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
